# Application

One use-case per file: `{verb}.use-case.ts`, `{Verb}UseCase.execute`. Tests: [tdd](./tdd.mdc).

Every use-case is an endpoint. The same `{verb}` is a procedure on `{context}.contract.ts`, a handler on `{context}.router.ts`, and a function in `{context}.api.ts` that calls `execute`. Another module may still call it through your port; the endpoint stays.

